[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13932.79, "timestamp": "03:52:12", "text": "芝麻。它看起来可能有点吓人，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13935.67, "timestamp": "03:52:15", "text": "当然，没有什么比这更明亮、更温暖的了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13937.59, "timestamp": "03:52:17", "text": "比火还猛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13939.83, "timestamp": "03:52:19", "text": "那是因为那位教导的共鸣器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13941.99, "timestamp": "03:52:21", "text": "他们还跟我说了很多话，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13945.189, "timestamp": "03:52:25", "text": "听不懂。但如果我不使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13947.99, "timestamp": "03:52:27", "text": "我的强项，我会明白这有什么意义。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13950.87, "timestamp": "03:52:30", "text": "寿命更长？我想活下去。我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13953.269, "timestamp": "03:52:33", "text": "能够很好地控制我的权力，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13955.51, "timestamp": "03:52:35", "text": "保护那些保护过我的人。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13963.269, "timestamp": "03:52:43", "text": "是的，据村里的老师说。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13965.429, "timestamp": "03:52:45", "text": "这些孩子，我得到的还是更少。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13966.99, "timestamp": "03:52:46", "text": "学习。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13969.67, "timestamp": "03:52:49", "text": "所以，我需要找个真正……的人。"}]